(docs/BUGS_FOUND.md #103: text is a field type. A field with a text
 default holds that text, one with "" holds the empty text, and one with
 no default holds the empty text too, never a missing one: printing the
 whole thing and each field shows all three.)

A thing called letter has
  a text called greeting is "dear friend",
  a text called postscript is "",
  a text called signature,
  a number called pages is 1.

a letter called note.
Print note.
Print note's greeting.
Print "[{note's postscript}]".
Print "[{note's signature}]".
